{
  "info": {
    "name": "Sonarfy - personal data",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Contract: docs/api/users-and-profile.md. Uses an active verified TEST account. PUT changes the account. Set a temporary accessToken locally without exporting it; occupiedHandle must belong to a different test account. Do not publish credential-filled variables or request traces."
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{accessToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080"
    },
    {
      "key": "accessToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "occupiedHandle",
      "value": "occupied.test"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Read personal data",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users/me",
        "header": []
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Replace personal fields and normalize handle",
      "request": {
        "method": "PUT",
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users/me",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Maria\",\n  \"surname\": \"Silva\",\n  \"handle\": \"Maria.Silva\",\n  \"city\": \"Campinas\",\n  \"country\": \"Brasil\",\n  \"birthDate\": \"2000-05-15\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "description": "PUT completo com handle em caixa mista: resposta e persistência em minúsculas. Formato do cadastro: 1–15 caracteres ASCII, números, _, - e ponto; sem @ ou espaços. Outra conta com o mesmo handle sem diferenciar caixa retorna 409. Atualiza os dados da conta de teste; não executar em conta real."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test(\"Updated handle\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().handle).to.eql(\"maria.silva\"));",
              "pm.test(\"Existing JSON keys\", () => { const body = pm.response.json(); pm.expect(body).to.have.property(\"active\"); pm.expect(body).to.have.property(\"profilePicture\"); pm.expect(body).not.to.have.property(\"displayName\"); });"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Invalid handle",
      "request": {
        "method": "PUT",
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users/me",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Maria\",\n  \"surname\": \"Silva\",\n  \"handle\": \"@invalid\",\n  \"city\": \"Campinas\",\n  \"country\": \"Brasil\",\n  \"birthDate\": \"2000-05-15\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
